      <!-- PUBG -->
      <div class="border-l-2 border-white/30 pl-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Back-end Engineer</h3>
        <p class="text-primary-light text-sm mb-1">PUBG Corporation, Seocho-gu, Seoul</p>
        <p class="text-text-muted text-sm mb-3">November 2017 – July 2018 (8 months)</p>
        <ul class="text-text-muted space-y-2 list-disc list-inside text-sm">
          <li>Assisted in development of microservices using Go and C#.</li>
          <li>Automated infrastructure using Terraform for numerous projects, from WordPress to machine learning systems.</li>
          <li>Set up data pipelines for public API service, a machine learning system, and general data analysis using AWS Lambda, SQS, S3, Redshift, and Kinesis.</li>
          <li>Set up GitLab CI configuration to enable faster building, testing, and deployment of projects.</li>
          <li>Helped deliver public API service written in Go, running on AWS ECS.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- SK Tech X -->
      <div class="border-l-2 border-white/30 pl-6">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold">Back-end Engineer</h3>
        <p class="text-primary-light text-sm mb-1">SK Tech X, Gangnam-gu, Seoul</p>
        <p class="text-text-muted text-sm mb-3">January 2017 – November 2017 (10 months)</p>
