          <li>Created Tableau reports on client network performance, game server capacity, NOC KPIs, and other game health metrics, using data in Hadoop Hive from millions of players across the globe.</li>
          <li>Developed a player impact REST API in Go, deployed on Docker, exposing abnormal metric values around the player experience.</li>
          <li>Automated over 400 requests and generation of promo codes by creating a PHP web app.</li>
          <li>Designed and taught Python basics class to NOC Technicians.</li>
